@startuml
title C4 code - Repository intelligence - context planning
package "Prism MCP server" {
  class "mcp.callTool" as Mcp <<existing function>>
  class "planRepositoryContext" as Planner <<function>>
  interface "RepositoryIntelligence" as Provider <<provider contract>> {
    + describe()
    + search(task, hints, options)
    + neighbors(nodes, options)
    + read(sourceRange)
  }
  class "CodeNibRepositoryIntelligence" as CodeNib <<class>>
  class "ContextPlan" as Plan <<return value>>
  class "TokenCounter" as Counter <<strategy>>
}
class "CodeNib MCP process" as Sidecar <<external process>>

Mcp --> Planner : requests a project context plan
Planner --> Provider : gets ranked anchors and bounded neighbors
Planner --> Provider : reads merged source ranges
Planner --> Counter : counts rendered read responses
Planner ..> Plan : returns classified context and diagnostics
CodeNib ..|> Provider : normalizes provider data
CodeNib --> Sidecar : uses hybrid search, graph, and source tools

note right of CodeNib
  Condition: CodeNib is absent or its index is stale.
  Response: return a provider diagnostic and no false FIT result.
  Governing ADR: provider-independent-context-planning.md
end note
@enduml
